<div data-type="problem">
<p>23. Complete and balance the following oxidation-reduction reactions, which give the highest possible oxidation state for the oxidized atoms.</p>

<p class="mt-indent-1">(a) \(\mathrm{Al}(s)+\mathrm{F}_2(g)\) \(\qquad\)<br />
